            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute abdominal pain is frequent and often distressing. This symptom must start a clinical investigation with mostly questioning and abdominal palpation for correct diagnosis and decision making. Half of the patients have either appendicitis or non-specific abdominal pain.</AbstractText>
